WEBVTT

00:00:00.472 --> 00:00:02.052
Suppose your goal for the year is to

00:00:02.052 --> 00:00:04.072
spend more quality time as a family.

00:00:05.012 --> 00:00:07.152
For the season, you make that more specific:

00:00:08.012 --> 00:00:10.392
build a habit of spending time outdoors together.

00:00:11.352 --> 00:00:14.212
This month, you set a smaller goal: go

00:00:14.212 --> 00:00:16.632
on two family walks, and pick the two

00:00:16.632 --> 00:00:17.652
days you’d like to go.
